  "claim": "The store where an IMAX Digital 3D theater is in is a furniture retailer with a location in an enclosed shopping mall on the north side of Interstate 295 near the junction with Interstate 95.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Jordan's Furniture. Sentence: Jordan's Furniture is a furniture retailer in New England.\nPage: Jordan's Furniture. Sentence: There are currently seven locations - in Reading, Avon, Taunton, Natick, Massachusetts, Nashua, New Hampshire, Warwick Mall in Warwick, Rhode Island, and New Haven, Connecticut.\nPage: Warwick Mall. Sentence: Warwick Mall is an enclosed shopping mall in Warwick, Rhode Island, on the north side of Interstate 295 near the junction with Interstate 95.\nPage: Jordan's IMAX. Sentence: The Sunbrella IMAX Theaters (formerly the Verizon IMAX Theaters) are two IMAX Digital 3D theaters located in Jordan's Furniture stores in Natick, Massachusetts and Reading, Massachusetts.",
